# SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
# Scene hl3-arrival (test/README.md): hldemo3 from its arrival spot (the
# hldemo2_3 landmark switch's), west along the arrival corridor (hellbox
# trigger_once #307), hellbox_grunt_script, the detonator plunger ->
# hellbox_exp_1 (env_explosion, magnitude 150) and the dome door:
# uplink.route lines 316-351 unchanged (route ops 203-225). New Game on hldemo3: hldemo2 is not open behind the player.
# scene-window: uplink 203 226
startmap hldemo3
waitmap hldemo3 60
# the route's player has the suit here (hldemo1's item_suit): drop it on
# him (HLSDK CBaseEntity::Create, touch pickup)
setpos -438 -576 -476 0 177
wait 0.3
drop item_suit -438 -576 -476
wait 1.5
stats begin
look 0 177
wait 0.5
shot hldemo3-arrival
stats hldemo3
# west along the arrival corridor: hellbox trigger_once #307
setpos -600 -568 -470 0 180
wait 0.3
setpos -696 -400 -470 0 90
wait 0.3
# From here on grunts shoot and a zombie claws the route, which does not
# fight (old host without god: 66 hp lost here; with hldemo2-return's 30 and
# hldemo1-return's 10 the carried health runs out): god, combat is not under
# test.
god 1
# hellbox_grunt_script walks hellbox_grunt to the hellbox; the detonator
# plunger (func_door, use only -> hellbox_detonate_mm_rl -> hellbox_detonate_mm)
# blows it (env_explosion hellbox_exp_1, magnitude 150) with him and the grunt
# guarding the dome door beside it, as the level is played. Left alive they
# chase the route into the antechamber and stand where the welder grunts
# spawn and run (welder_grunt_spawner_*, welder_grunt_ss_*).
waitclass monster_human_grunt -672 -64 -512 16 20
setpos -764 -420 -470 40 180
wait 0.3
+use
wait 0.2
-use
waitgone hellbox_exp_1 5
wait 1
# intro dome door button #42 -> intro_domedoor_mm -> intro_domedoor_1 (4 s)
setpos -672 -64 -470 0 0
wait 0.5
+use
wait 0.2
-use
waitmoved intro_domedoor_1 15
stats end
wait 0.2
pass
